{"name":"久岐忍","name_en":"Kuki Shinobu","sources":["hoyolab"],"items":[{"title":"初次见面","title_en":"","text":"你好，我是荒泷派的二把手久岐忍。我们承包多种业务，货运物流、安保维持、房屋补漏、表演驻唱等等。需要我们请随时联系，这是我的名片，还请收下。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/2931d84c67adefa3af10ca6e365ce34d_1229188599994941501.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/69ed957cec48a81261eb746ed6d61ecf_643119625105394319.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/3c2553e794c8bb8eefe75d447c813ad1_2190434124729379388.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/f8001686a8a674c380a3c46754e6635f_7464228687468222968.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"闲聊·麻烦事","title_en":"","text":"有麻烦事要处理的话，直接告诉我就好，我来摆平。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/9ac3844d270f066f92117e0d60818a7c_5297211356767171426.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/92e2c3484f9ca335555185ba51ce2930_3909542077514049698.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/4b5c68e214b22036bfbe86d244398624_8860474603507377303.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/92b530cb51dbae6b152acc763d80299b_2303056573830488653.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"闲聊·证书","title_en":"","text":"执业证书考试都有固定评判标准，肯学肯练就能考过，没什么难的。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/66119ce568dee237eae6083c6926eb06_7700834428673034621.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/4b59c2a03bba51666348349443bbc9c3_3771453690730289311.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/cac2913cf4c8dcc778c0a5fe3d34225c_6100339133947253422.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/6999b746397f2cdfc6a3c8aa06994306_32075002656977204.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"闲聊·荒泷派","title_en":"","text":"要是荒泷派犯了事，我会揪他们去认错的。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/f23f4ccb949601b78a88e2c7acf5a60a_7252698858114887733.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/8c9bfb948129f791fa8e4fae28b299f3_7964095437148591044.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/1d9cace376924df25d16105359b8447d_2954907818743920854.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/4de6fa80f5f319e90698b8a3e985dca9_1180515538199135478.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"下雨的时候","title_en":"","text":"不用打伞了，腿脚快点就行。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/0cc6406585599d22f88329ff5ef63b1c_2016060097708041487.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/841f6558b6ee775144fc95632b46a7e3_3625919077445528017.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/86843c7c712987a7b15d04b4d5931918_5024328274752275782.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/9cd897d5d550823340e67ae4040da774_163443407092220696.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"打雷的时候","title_en":"","text":"当心点。这种天，应该没人会想引雷上身吧？","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/d0d9f55779bbbcadc49da7ce1c053470_4188061347338849443.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/646b060ca2f0e00700707ba49d0bc20d_5618375915524244853.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/c22c8e1e769261a61775aa5a56e7aa3f_2911030902676870538.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/0ef63b0da0bd5904396f4d3f0a4276a6_7932978079373732275.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"下雪的时候","title_en":"","text":"快点把事情办完就撤吧，别浪费时间。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/6c62550cbdccfff9e5858f970c50624f_8926696865622267251.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/013b8bc20628b5cc54ffce0af107a9d6_3493062094197056799.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/004d7529b6179c626a17c9bacb2b80ee_1958601743963104298.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/f8ccdee94979c169fc7b0b7c91358cf7_5364390670569140046.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"阳光很好","title_en":"","text":"嗯，天气真好，但总有种不祥的预感…希望是我多虑了吧。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/87d8694194f962dbb54735759e675d5e_9057753989364409429.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/a60e0f0318948406f4a1fc6501333ad5_4156959362382593695.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/d67be215011a921edd491568d6d0a897_2394699945500917284.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/1e43a448d548187e57847ded16e067f4_7547701147515906897.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"刮大风了","title_en":"","text":"唔…这风还算不错。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/8beaf9d79e4e1a08cee204b60a8d3572_6620628346119019927.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/d73f71cb7649b69ab0259ef289d475b8_8961447204416573608.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/3a7a0d7d2a40ca31e756acda4caec810_5315244921031503444.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/ab4703de5719e9fc57c7b6c913b8aae2_3993426745269618418.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"早上好","title_en":"","text":"早啊，看你的样子是准备去锻炼了？没想到你还挺勤快的。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/8b67b34d59a0e4fc48085c8c032afcb3_9206726868022097966.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/33bf15214f55c63af63ebaf026abb155_1531837661221069466.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/9523505a2b0d58a63a2ffa7743d9af95_5574715226035619927.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/0ba45c7687a502b2ae213fd18e06d7e7_6850407753805308469.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"中午好","title_en":"","text":"想吃什么？最近攒了不少钱，午饭我请你。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/8424308c7a3fd3f711c894d8ebca501b_1941885909099908907.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/af94cec144edf9cc250c17d620767014_2207174748999765693.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/b3051adae213c0c486253bb3075c894f_7636755023790247018.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/9952cfb9c6f22c0ed398da2d25e090d6_2818398071009103793.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"晚上好","title_en":"","text":"有些委托，在夜晚才好办。我不放心交给他们，都是我亲自上。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/23220ce86fb9a7c3c2806b3b7e6086b2_6845193659083084967.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/b65fe1d1ebd08d55fc4682244fbf668f_1869629936697446227.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/bf883dae71e69a625044868723e87e28_5488162903263017719.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/362e831923b4324168dab57acf4ab6cf_5957851881856390177.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"晚安","title_en":"","text":"该休息的时候就去休息吧，不用管我。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/6d35015cc6e804c9132c264bfc4294ed_7589299434233271139.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/5770a2ee2f8b2e489e05cdca4f93ff28_9154218619580066810.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/380603bff6b9a75b96ca29cc1d523cd9_1603558877056144101.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/de68bb67cd82cdbfa2fbb70d01c5c7ee_2642787938741909570.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"关于久岐忍自己·二把手","title_en":"","text":"招揽业务、维系成员安定是我的职责，除此之外还有——去奉行所捞人，归还零食和玩具，抓捕接了活却在暗处偷懒的成员…不过，这些额外工作属于荒泷派特色，其他任何组织的二把手，理论上都不需要做这些。当然，也做不到像我这样。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/20efa461d773426e99dbf878a12c2519_231503748660441976.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/2ed89a0330479eae475c92f041057818_3048594803273805583.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/83d5a335345cf87f2869b71c7b20b2b2_1324981013215519024.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/0251d0df3d07bdba612db7715bb21c5d_2246275782783076534.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"关于久岐忍自己·退路","title_en":"","text":"你说帮派解散？首先，那种事应该不会发生。其次，就算发生了，我有什么好担心的呢。饿肚子的人不可能是我。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/863860d35ab79cf9683968e9bbc81464_6798324729755127548.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/364a531d6ba1455c0e05c46cc48a8639_9159166986083987648.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/85e6613997bc8a7d2f9d94700bae104e_1113811642326487579.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/f108040b1b3298d0d24a637068d4a671_5622924924104857147.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"关于我们·笔记","title_en":"","text":"要是你心血来潮想考什么证，不如直接找我吧，我把笔记借你。备注和要点很详细，不愁你学不会。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/5112606f68c9fe994badb984c68c22bd_4544699561724391594.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/e9d6b2936d3d794fbfafc26d09310812_544791414623240617.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/630beef95477a6002d66e4eb12f965d8_2200311197938564987.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/69366bc913354d29ebc8fefcddbb0ad7_8684241751157896589.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"关于我们·善后","title_en":"","text":"不管你是不是荒泷派的人，我都不会把你当外人。你就往前走吧，幕后的工作交给我。放心，这方面我是专业的，多复杂的事都能办妥。嗯？担心我的安危？呵，这方面你也放心吧，这些年的摸爬滚打，不是白经历的。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/edeec214e6778b9f50ca0b9e5e33c0ee_6450552735008259628.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/a633b24fc09ad6c0d95ba306040f4ea8_5172499764302584012.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/0f16b943c7d2a93c2b138755a85709b4_5322064898633530421.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/17e94eafa609f5906faf22f200fd4698_7541098552740543921.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"关于「神之眼」","title_en":"","text":"和证书一样，这是对我能力的肯定和证明。但不同的是，我至今不知道它的考核标准。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/28e50fdb230241260b1c21d8b96b10a1_1189639455664554604.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/42b127bf137f01a16dc570631d3dea1d_3289786302405929258.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/3666696500484130fb8225691af8aad8_2213621813322151394.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/07a0db60e842134108b6665857645fc7_2389312837825263890.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"有什么想要分享·面铠","title_en":"","text":"戴上面铠是不想被熟人认出来。尤其和荒泷派一起出任务时，要是熟人看见了，指指点点，那群家伙肯定会趁机起哄。啧，光是想想，就很烦。不能再有下次了…咳，没什么。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/fcd6ba2bf265afd88fa208d3df96348d_8402233128099240591.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/06b9c43605a5e5ebc5fb40f720e63dce_8157121360870165880.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/07f8b088e15249fe8aff4916454fc5e7_2197553945471258833.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/a9880ecaaad9be277eb73b3e3aa23a34_1396011691089886050.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"有什么想要分享·派中法度","title_en":"","text":"我制定了荒泷派的「派中法度」，他们就应该谨遵法度行事。嗯？你问他们为什么愿意听话？因为我比他们更有说服力。我的语言和拳头，姑且还算是有点分量。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/fcfe98452879fb7b85a2faf70ac10c6f_1701472188780375868.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/6f2e8092838ba2c99a6e7be1e38eac63_6343432847383887880.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/2ee134c812a64ea19688806638a0bca3_3305442817365010650.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/e9f1845c2adaa154397ad0f8c35cac91_1227955532218594323.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"感兴趣的见闻","title_en":"","text":"神社中流传着一种说法，将鸣草织成一个圈缠在身上，就能祛灾祈福，你信吗？我倒觉得，鸣草，还是麻痹效果更实用。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/7333d1de80c415c07ca2791981229b4d_6500298890416722458.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/a6ae9ff6956e25a57895a6fb2ca10754_4716234411808408248.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/bf37b03312d5dee2ad6a143c37989de8_496127655783991664.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/975057d937b1eff0f66b96eb78284817_560900433611965963.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"关于雷电将军","title_en":"","text":"解除锁国后，雷电将军陆续颁布了不少法令支持各行各业的发展。我在锁国期间考的证书全都派上了用场，荒泷派也不那么拮据了。祸福相依，没想到到头来还得感谢她。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/5be18d903f1e77107674c7906635e416_6572171596558237066.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/d08211a74ceeb8dced5989b688fe9baa_8813099318965231948.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/091b20e201fa7e70b8436c2f6f32d6c3_2217057032559083849.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/d39283f3c279c21aaa79495679643ec9_5220558145621294847.mp3"}},"line":0},{"title":"关于九条裟罗","title_en":"","text":"九条小姐啊，她是我的朋友。嗯？我认识她让你觉得很意外吗？噢，你可能误会了，我加入荒泷派之前就跟她有交情。我们俩的切磋，还难分胜负呢。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/ec7377c1367dc9d5d69689dde9c8300e_8726088447200156084.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/84055a294d178c1127f2ba7cc5f3fc93_950345538890984131.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/3667e28be29fec586c72693da4a28510_572312984184258465.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/0a3faf6766eef0cef22681d862b27050_1813325392478679999.mp3"}},"line":1},{"title":"关于八重神子","title_en":"","text":"就连堂堂鸣神大社的宫司大人，都要靠副业来解闷，可见当巫女是有多无聊。我是绝对不会回去当巫女的。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/8010e7fa349392c29db657c261116a35_611105550862165277.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/e3a73e4c4b0c5a86e146ef2a05ce2a60_7505557903218295039.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/0d204aa02d4f70bf4f29489509fe05d3_3466718138699313008.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/a9d5d4eb2a52c3a1da732ef22550f280_3503408472827653371.mp3"}},"line":2},{"title":"关于荒泷一斗","title_en":"","text":"老大有很多不算愉快的过去，却还能保持快乐阳光，挺难得的。他对我们很不错，他的纯粹也感染着荒泷派的大家。当然，这不能成为他横冲直撞影响别人的借口。如果他找你麻烦，尽管告诉我。我会好好收拾他，让他后悔对你无礼。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/5f8435a2be742200fbd344007a862790_7782353678474838488.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/e1dcb583cba99ea21b007767c9b1d75a_8570808122806189483.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/c4b251c6c07da1f0f96b8598e1a371b4_944837518092211785.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/bed2bac886f8f1d448c5b08d615473bc_1625809919887356531.mp3"}},"line":3},{"title":"关于烟绯","title_en":"","text":"那时候跟家里闹翻了，只想着有多远逃多远，就跑去璃月学律法了。得亏这样，有幸认识了烟绯师姐。在律法咨询这块，她简直就是活字典。我？执业证书倒是有的，不过这个职业的约束也不少，并不是最适合我的。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/7bc6c1fdda3cb21533a7773a28792e4c_5148619206550024921.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/3b40378ff6d26ca9cfeccfd06c3f199f_1574073525125980970.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/da9402c210f5c5f3ea2fcb59cd19a548_6814982373256325970.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/7f454881c06f15e95e4058c9078a93d9_669949051262125012.mp3"}},"line":4},{"title":"关于鹿野院平藏","title_en":"","text":"他和普通天领奉行同心不一样，从未见他做什么巡逻、抓捕的活。他偶尔会找我买线索，作为交换，我希望他能在我去奉行所捞人时帮我美言几句，他也爽快答应了。这笔交易还算值，毕竟让弟兄们收集点市井见闻是很简单的事。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/2f1ef3c456575aa9bdbd73e686800edf_4978790691086268120.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/ae394ef61227bbca3d70ef77dae1fab8_2964774441861342858.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/68fb96794baa7568701e73af999c790d_4534454280679757922.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/ace1a2dcc1dd5017a41200a501c6aeae_3543433738074964011.mp3"}},"line":5},{"title":"想要了解久岐忍·其一","title_en":"","text":"我做过很多不同的工作，相关的执业证书也有不少。管理方面，带过小型团队，负责人员统筹和资源调配…呃，抱歉，面试多了就说习惯了，别介意。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/f39c4cff22fd6fd61e1d366fc23bc591_5858866311198164769.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/6a1991bf51ac8a0a51e4209df8587400_3644562579358350399.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/51b5c7ae58419659526a74d689b02316_2469075545636218251.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/bc5575252668cc548148f370a182773f_5992771475388003844.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"想要了解久岐忍·其二","title_en":"","text":"我家是巫女世家，但我不适合当巫女。刚逃出来那会儿，我觉得要多积累，以免没有傍身之技。什么厨师、裁缝、格斗、律法咨询、出版编辑…我都学了。没想到真正进了社会才发现，学的已经完全够用了。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/da46f9cb77868fe26e23fedc5048de73_1288960425287254433.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/30a7b078322d0fd87fe729c323b681d6_7621792637110577711.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/c1dc3d24cd691e0bb91630a766e632f9_5452439211666983044.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/e49394b63444e8d13e51674fb87adcf6_5306445599217244406.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"想要了解久岐忍·其三","title_en":"","text":"你说我社交场合很厉害？呵，毕竟在外流浪了那么久，总得学会察言观色。更何况在多数时候，理亏的那一方都是我们。我不讨厌摆出那些表情，但可以的话，我还是选择不笑的好。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/a8bf5e02c8d04f86c78f4cece16956c5_231922943598419331.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/93ea13a0c20a8338bea35f6a485553fb_4789308535138005860.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/d59e738152f21a2ba26c1b2a1eaa0884_5031818008445261658.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/d0e8fccb054fa3a79cfafbde9c95dd00_8272980253288599695.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"想要了解久岐忍·其四","title_en":"","text":"刚进荒泷派的时候，老大要我教小弟们怎么打架。所以我上来第一件事，就变成了把他们挨个揍趴下。没想到，一个个鼻青眼肿的，却睁大眼睛，张嘴就叫我「忍姐」，还要我好好带领他们。哼，那时候我就知道这是一群笨蛋。但没关系，笨蛋不会拖我后腿，我会解决一切问题。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/33750f9dd9c939c12941973568dd750a_103696435862067924.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/9204b1f5817006b6e8c4b2a2db5125d4_8655010609670701982.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/2d3dabded4940b32423ad13aa42fbe4b_4574691579533892552.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/abee6355f36b9e58ac9b51735b7b4fe1_1800628105496678257.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"想要了解久岐忍·其五","title_en":"","text":"留在荒泷派是我自己的选择。收拾烂摊子难免令人火大，但他们也给了我无可替代的真诚。最好的东西都先留给我、从不泼我冷水、在我宣布决定后闹哄哄地鼓掌吹口哨…我知道外面对荒泷派的评价不太好，他们自己也不在乎，但我还是想努努力，改变别人对我们的印象。因为，对待「家人」，自己可以偶尔抱怨，但就是不想其他人说他们的不好。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/376eb409861c7fcd3f284e9f21d6b74d_7323051248245498290.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/afec36e144cdaf4951e5139e6e34602a_3061540033162118622.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/e08205472f791164d64a4f35ed136567_1277260517933367260.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/4592d2396af25ae8bf36d240a3e9ca76_3510280753084472507.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"久岐忍的爱好","title_en":"","text":"平时混帮派，闲着也是闲着，经常不小心读完一本书，不小心就把证考了。不也挺好吗？家里问起来，我也没虚度时光，出去谈工作，也算得上有资本。在这个凡事讲究实力的社会里，我这种有证书的混子，到哪里都能吃得饱饭。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/76b97d13804eb1b769dd44230386ef41_1337337457043314685.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/f4ff30b4c3aab789426fdf0b851b83ca_774935128170240859.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/35f5c2588848b1378f417f960410d14e_6660092312124753865.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/69476703916a852ad1c9a50285819781_2550030911498523598.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"久岐忍的烦恼","title_en":"","text":"以前不想被抓回去当巫女，就决心只靠自己站稳脚跟。至少目前看来，我干得还不错。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/d72f17fefeca57d3fbe03bec4c8cc5d2_8466504383895308683.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/5d5c1ba35c4dba3c75f1c1667338e267_3003202784294263451.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/87f5ee967b26103f6931a5013c6a460c_2331393046062238557.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/a802da5f9da02fa568e7dadc60dfa844_3615968705088471232.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"喜欢的食物","title_en":"","text":"就算刚吃过拉面或者饺子之类很管饱的食物，最后还是想以一小碗米饭结束。米饭好吃，没什么其他原因，有问题吗？","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/6d2f108c1e94ded53eab9c20f651590d_3673179110520241317.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/56018e6d73eb077faf5c6e8dc6260787_6585550908271842115.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/c603714add63b9c6b17b4dbaba12dc71_7653930784762112255.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/9b40efbbbd0b8741f098fc12c306d5fa_3776546945164752045.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"讨厌的食物","title_en":"","text":"厨师证到手后，我就更加坚定那个从璃月听来的说法：没有难吃的食物，只有不合格的厨师。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/00eb59fa7a4d2cce0552f466025365a7_3501849021876405350.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/c403d98685a6096c1f715835fffff2d9_370109418656277195.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/98418861462241cd5a30c8b0d4cf9c3a_820211034955806293.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/bff7475f06f7d2b2bcaa778d7cfcc89a_6540158783294778129.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"收到赠礼·其一","title_en":"","text":"真不简单。咳…我就再多吃一口。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/986202b7989b21f8c1af14ea346befc6_1721101036359329373.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/2eae8827d1e50d64f94964a827104a6f_7656806626841451654.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/507214b68b2958ad0a72b1ddda22fd01_4896968840542382062.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-a